{"lineas":[{"speaker":"Alice","start":0,"end":10.64,"text":"David, I need you to picture this: a nearsighted plasterer from England, glasses so thick they fogged up mid-air, hurling himself off an Olympic ski jump.","words":[{"w":"David,","s":0,"e":0.88},{"w":"I","s":0.88,"e":1.12},{"w":"need","s":1.12,"e":1.36},{"w":"you","s":1.36,"e":1.52},{"w":"to","s":1.52,"e":1.68},{"w":"picture","s":1.68,"e":2},{"w":"this:","s":2,"e":2.56},{"w":"a","s":2.72,"e":2.96},{"w":"nearsighted","s":2.96,"e":3.6},{"w":"plasterer","s":3.6,"e":4.24},{"w":"from","s":4.24,"e":4.48},{"w":"England,","s":4.48,"e":5.2},{"w":"glasses","s":5.36,"e":5.84},{"w":"so","s":5.84,"e":6.16},{"w":"thick","s":6.16,"e":6.4},{"w":"they","s":6.4,"e":6.72},{"w":"fogged","s":6.72,"e":7.12},{"w":"up","s":7.12,"e":7.28},{"w":"mid-air,","s":7.28,"e":8.08},{"w":"hurling","s":8.08,"e":8.48},{"w":"himself","s":8.48,"e":8.88},{"w":"off","s":8.88,"e":9.2},{"w":"an","s":9.2,"e":9.36},{"w":"Olympic","s":9.36,"e":9.76},{"w":"ski","s":9.76,"e":10.08},{"w":"jump.","s":10.08,"e":10.64}]},{"speaker":"David","start":10.72,"end":19.185,"text":"Oh, I know exactly who you mean, and honestly, I have been waiting years for someone to bring up Eddie the Eagle so I can finally start an argument.","words":[{"w":"Oh,","s":10.72,"e":11.04},{"w":"I","s":11.04,"e":11.2},{"w":"know","s":11.2,"e":11.36},{"w":"exactly","s":11.36,"e":11.84},{"w":"who","s":11.84,"e":12.08},{"w":"you","s":12.08,"e":12.32},{"w":"mean,","s":12.32,"e":12.56},{"w":"and","s":12.785,"e":13.345},{"w":"honestly,","s":13.345,"e":13.745},{"w":"I","s":13.825,"e":14.065},{"w":"have","s":14.065,"e":14.225},{"w":"been","s":14.225,"e":14.465},{"w":"waiting","s":14.465,"e":14.785},{"w":"years","s":14.785,"e":15.105},{"w":"for","s":15.105,"e":15.345},{"w":"someone","s":15.345,"e":15.665},{"w":"to","s":15.665,"e":15.825},{"w":"bring","s":15.825,"e":16.065},{"w":"up","s":16.065,"e":16.225},{"w":"Eddie","s":16.225,"e":16.545},{"w":"the","s":16.545,"e":16.705},{"w":"Eagle","s":16.705,"e":17.025},{"w":"so","s":17.025,"e":17.265},{"w":"I","s":17.265,"e":17.425},{"w":"can","s":17.425,"e":17.585},{"w":"finally","s":17.585,"e":18.065},{"w":"start","s":18.065,"e":18.385},{"w":"an","s":18.385,"e":18.545},{"w":"argument.","s":18.545,"e":19.185}]},{"speaker":"Alice","start":19.425,"end":31.88,"text":"Michael Edwards, Calgary, 1988. No money, no coach, no talent by Olympic standards, and he still fought his way into the Games. That is genuinely extraordinary to me.","words":[{"w":"Michael","s":19.425,"e":19.825},{"w":"Edwards,","s":19.825,"e":20.625},{"w":"Calgary,","s":20.625,"e":21.425},{"w":"1988.","s":21.425,"e":22.945},{"w":"No","s":22.945,"e":23.265},{"w":"money,","s":23.265,"e":23.905},{"w":"no","s":23.905,"e":24.145},{"w":"coach,","s":24.145,"e":24.785},{"w":"no","s":24.785,"e":25.025},{"w":"talent","s":25.025,"e":25.425},{"w":"by","s":25.425,"e":25.665},{"w":"Olympic","s":25.665,"e":26.145},{"w":"standards,","s":26.145,"e":26.545},{"w":"and","s":26.76,"e":27.08},{"w":"he","s":27.08,"e":27.24},{"w":"still","s":27.24,"e":27.56},{"w":"fought","s":27.56,"e":27.8},{"w":"his","s":27.8,"e":28.04},{"w":"way","s":28.04,"e":28.2},{"w":"into","s":28.2,"e":28.52},{"w":"the","s":28.52,"e":28.6},{"w":"Games.","s":28.6,"e":29.32},{"w":"That","s":29.32,"e":29.64},{"w":"is","s":29.64,"e":29.8},{"w":"genuinely","s":29.8,"e":30.44},{"w":"extraordinary","s":30.44,"e":31.16},{"w":"to","s":31.16,"e":31.4},{"w":"me.","s":31.4,"e":31.88}]},{"speaker":"David","start":32.12,"end":42.68,"text":"Extraordinary, sure, but let's be precise about what happened: he finished dead last in both events, by margins so enormous the commentators ran out of polite things to say.","words":[{"w":"Extraordinary,","s":32.12,"e":33.08},{"w":"sure,","s":33.08,"e":33.64},{"w":"but","s":33.72,"e":33.96},{"w":"let's","s":33.96,"e":34.28},{"w":"be","s":34.28,"e":34.52},{"w":"precise","s":34.52,"e":34.92},{"w":"about","s":34.92,"e":35.24},{"w":"what","s":35.24,"e":35.4},{"w":"happened:","s":35.