 But somewhere in a very serious office, the Olympic Committee was watching this circus and quietly losing its mind.","words":[{"w":"It's","s":52.575,"e":52.895},{"w":"a","s":52.895,"e":53.055},{"w":"great","s":53.055,"e":53.295},{"w":"story,","s":53.295,"e":53.935},{"w":"I'll","s":53.935,"e":54.175},{"w":"give","s":54.175,"e":54.335},{"w":"you","s":54.335,"e":54.495},{"w":"that.","s":54.495,"e":54.655},{"w":"But","s":55.3,"e":55.54},{"w":"somewhere","s":55.54,"e":56.02},{"w":"in","s":56.02,"e":56.26},{"w":"a","s":56.26,"e":56.42},{"w":"very","s":56.42,"e":56.66},{"w":"serious","s":56.66,"e":57.14},{"w":"office,","s":57.14,"e":57.86},{"w":"the","s":57.86,"e":58.02},{"w":"Olympic","s":58.02,"e":58.42},{"w":"Committee","s":58.42,"e":58.82},{"w":"was","s":58.82,"e":59.14},{"w":"watching","s":59.14,"e":59.46},{"w":"this","s":59.46,"e":59.62},{"w":"circus","s":59.62,"e":60.1},{"w":"and","s":60.1,"e":60.5},{"w":"quietly","s":60.5,"e":61.06},{"w":"losing","s":61.06,"e":61.46},{"w":"its","s":61.46,"e":61.7},{"w":"mind.","s":61.7,"e":62.18}]},{"speaker":"Alice","start":62.34,"end":72.195,"text":"Okay, back up for anyone who missed this saga. Eddie was a plasterer — he fixed walls for a living — and one day he simply decided he wanted the Olympics.","words":[{"w":"Okay,","s":62.34,"e":63.22},{"w":"back","s":63.22,"e":63.54},{"w":"up","s":63.54,"e":63.7},{"w":"for","s":63.7,"e":63.94},{"w":"anyone","s":63.94,"e":64.26},{"w":"who","s":64.26,"e":64.42},{"w":"missed","s":64.42,"e":64.74},{"w":"this","s":64.74,"e":64.98},{"w":"saga.","s":64.98,"e":65.62},{"w":"Eddie","s":65.86,"e":66.18},{"w":"was","s":66.18,"e":66.34},{"w":"a","s":66.34,"e":66.5},{"w":"plasterer","s":66.5,"e":67.06},{"w":"—","s":67.06,"e":67.235},{"w":"he","s":67.235,"e":67.555},{"w":"fixed","s":67.555,"e":67.875},{"w":"walls","s":67.875,"e":68.195},{"w":"for","s":68.195,"e":68.435},{"w":"a","s":68.435,"e":68.515},{"w":"living","s":68.515,"e":69.075},{"w":"—","s":69.075,"e":69.11500000000001},{"w":"and","s":69.075,"e":69.235},{"w":"one","s":69.235,"e":69.475},{"w":"day","s":69.475,"e":69.715},{"w":"he","s":69.715,"e":69.955},{"w":"simply","s":69.955,"e":70.275},{"w":"decided","s":70.275,"e":70.755},{"w":"he","s":70.755,"e":70.995},{"w":"wanted","s":70.995,"e":71.235},{"w":"the","s":71.235,"e":71.395},{"w":"Olympics.","s":71.395,"e":72.195}]},{"speaker":"David","start":72.435,"end":81.715,"text":"And here's the loophole: Britain had no other ski jumpers at all, so the qualifying bar was basically lying on the ground. He just had to show up and survive.","words":[{"w":"And","s":72.435,"e":72.595},{"w":"here's","s":72.595,"e":72.995},{"w":"the","s":72.995,"e":73.075},{"w":"loophole:","s":73.075,"e":73.955},{"w":"Britain","s":74.035,"e":74.435},{"w":"had","s":74.435,"e":74.675},{"w":"no","s":74.675,"e":74.915},{"w":"other","s":74.915,"e":75.155},{"w":"ski","s":75.155,"e":75.395},{"w":"jumpers","s":75.395,"e":75.875},{"w":"at","s":75.875,"e":76.035},{"w":"all,","s":76.035,"e":76.515},{"w":"so","s":76.595,"e":76.755},{"w":"the","s":76.755,"e":76.995},{"w":"qualifying","s":76.995,"e":77.555},{"w":"bar","s":77.555,"e":77.875},{"w":"was","s":77.875,"e":78.115},{"w":"basically","s":78.115,"e":78.595},{"w":"lying","s":78.595,"e":78.915},{"w":"on","s":78.915,"e":79.155},{"w":"the","s":79.155,"e":79.235},{"w":"ground.","s":79.235,"e":79.795},{"w":"He","s":80.035,"e":80.195},{"w":"just","s":80.195,"e":80.435},{"w":"had","s":80.435,"e":80.675},{"w":"to","s":80.675,"e":80.835},{"w":"show","s":80.835,"e":80.995},{"w":"up","s":80.995,"e":81.235},{"w":"and","s":81.235,"e":81.395},{"w":"survive.","s":81.395,"e":81.715}]},{"speaker":"Alice","start":82.28,"end":89.64,"text":"He was broke, though. He slept in his car, borrowed equipment, wore six pairs of socks because his boots were too big.","words":[{"w":"He","s":82.28,"e":82.6},{"w":"was","s":82.6,"e":82.76},{"w":"broke,","s":82.76,"e":83.08},{"w":"though.","s":83.08,"e":83.72},{"w":"He","s":83.72,"e":83.88},{"w":"slept","s":83.88,"e":84.2},{