"e":101.685},{"w":"repairman","s":101.685,"e":102.325},{"w":"clawed","s":102.325,"e":102.725},{"w":"his","s":102.725,"e":102.885},{"w":"way","s":102.885,"e":103.045},{"w":"to","s":103.045,"e":103.205},{"w":"the","s":103.205,"e":103.365},{"w":"Olympic","s":103.365,"e":103.765},{"w":"Games.","s":103.765,"e":104.485}]},{"speaker":"David","start":104.485,"end":108.405,"text":"Against all odds. That's exactly the phrase for this, isn't it?","words":[{"w":"Against","s":104.485,"e":104.805},{"w":"all","s":104.805,"e":105.205},{"w":"odds.","s":105.205,"e":105.845},{"w":"That's","s":105.845,"e":106.245},{"w":"exactly","s":106.245,"e":106.725},{"w":"the","s":106.725,"e":106.885},{"w":"phrase","s":106.885,"e":107.205},{"w":"for","s":107.205,"e":107.365},{"w":"this,","s":107.365,"e":107.685},{"w":"isn't","s":107.685,"e":107.925},{"w":"it?","s":107.925,"e":108.405}]},{"speaker":"Alice","start":108.565,"end":119.8,"text":"It's perfect. When something happens against all odds, it succeeds despite everything pointing to failure. No money, no coach, terrible eyesight — every odd was against him.","words":[{"w":"It's","s":108.565,"e":108.965},{"w":"perfect.","s":108.965,"e":109.605},{"w":"When","s":109.765,"e":110.005},{"w":"something","s":110.005,"e":110.405},{"w":"happens","s":110.405,"e":110.805},{"w":"against","s":110.805,"e":111.205},{"w":"all","s":111.205,"e":111.525},{"w":"odds,","s":111.525,"e":111.845},{"w":"it","s":112.04,"e":112.36},{"w":"succeeds","s":112.36,"e":112.92},{"w":"despite","s":112.92,"e":113.4},{"w":"everything","s":113.4,"e":113.8},{"w":"pointing","s":113.8,"e":114.2},{"w":"to","s":114.2,"e":114.36},{"w":"failure.","s":114.36,"e":115.08},{"w":"No","s":115.24,"e":115.48},{"w":"money,","s":115.48,"e":116.04},{"w":"no","s":116.04,"e":116.28},{"w":"coach,","s":116.28,"e":116.92},{"w":"terrible","s":116.92,"e":117.4},{"w":"eyesight","s":117.4,"e":118.28},{"w":"—","s":118.28,"e":118.32000000000001},{"w":"every","s":118.28,"e":118.52},{"w":"odd","s":118.52,"e":118.76},{"w":"was","s":118.76,"e":119},{"w":"against","s":119,"e":119.32},{"w":"him.","s":119.32,"e":119.8}]},{"speaker":"David","start":120.04,"end":129.995,"text":"And English adores it. Sports commentary, movie trailers — against all odds, they won the title. It's the soundtrack of every underdog story.","words":[{"w":"And","s":120.04,"e":120.2},{"w":"English","s":120.2,"e":120.68},{"w":"adores","s":120.68,"e":121.16},{"w":"it.","s":121.16,"e":121.64},{"w":"Sports","s":121.88,"e":122.2},{"w":"commentary,","s":122.2,"e":123.08},{"w":"movie","s":123.16,"e":123.48},{"w":"trailers","s":123.48,"e":124.28},{"w":"—","s":124.28,"e":124.32000000000001},{"w":"against","s":124.28,"e":124.6},{"w":"all","s":124.6,"e":124.92},{"w":"odds,","s":124.92,"e":125.56},{"w":"they","s":125.56,"e":125.8},{"w":"won","s":125.8,"e":126.12},{"w":"the","s":126.12,"e":126.28},{"w":"title.","s":126.28,"e":126.6},{"w":"It's","s":127.035,"e":127.355},{"w":"the","s":127.355,"e":127.515},{"w":"soundtrack","s":127.515,"e":128.075},{"w":"of","s":128.075,"e":128.315},{"w":"every","s":128.315,"e":128.715},{"w":"underdog","s":128.715,"e":129.275},{"w":"story.","s":129.275,"e":129.995}]},{"speaker":"Alice","start":129.995,"end":138.075,"text":"Calgary, February 1988. He jumps. He lands. He survives. Last place, but alive.","words":[{"w":"Calgary,","s":129.995,"e":130.795},{"w":"February","s":130.795,"e":131.355},{"w":"1988.","s":131.355,"e":132.875},{"w":"He","s":132.875,"e":133.115},{"w":"jumps.","s":133.115,"e":133.835},{"w":"He","s":133.835,"e":134.075},{"w":"lands.","s":134.075,"e":134.715},{"w":"He","s":134.795,"e":135.035},{"w":"survives.","s":135.035,"e":135.915},{"w":"Last","s":136.155,"e":136.475},{"w":"place,","s":136.475,"e":137.115},{"w":"but","s":137.195,"e":137.355},{"w":"alive.","s":137.355,"e":138.075}]},{"speaker":"David","start":138.475,"end":146.13,"text":"Dead last in the seventy metres, dead last in the ninety. And overnight, Eddie became the butt of the joke worldwide.","words":[{"w":"Dead","s":138.475,"e":138.715},{"w":"last","s":138.715,"e":139.115},{"w":"in","s":139.115,"e":139.275},{"w":"the","s":139.275,"e":139.435},{"w":"seventy","s":139.435,"e":139.835},{"w":"metres,","s":139.835,"e":140.555},{"w":"dead","s":140.555,"e":140.875},{"w":"last","s":140.875,"e":141.195},{"w":"in","s":141.195,"e":141.435},{"w":"the","s":141.435,"e":141.515},{"w":"ninety.","s":141.515,"e":141.835},{"w":"And","s":142.29,"e":142.61},{"w":"overnight,","s":142.61,"e":143.41},{"w":"Eddie","s":143.41,"e":143.81},{"w":"became","s":143.81,"e":144.13},{"w":"the","s":144.13,"e":144.37},{"w":"butt","s":144.37,"e":144.61},{"w":"of","s":144.61,"e":144.69},{"w":"the","s":144.69,"e":144.85},{"w":"joke","s":144.85,"e":145.17},{"w":"worldwide.","s":145.17,"e":146.13}]},{"speaker":"Alice","start":146.77,"end":150.21,"text":"Ooh, hold on. That expression deserves a moment of its own.","words":[{"w":"Ooh,","s":146.77,"e":146.81},{"w":"hold","s":146.77,"e":147.17},{"w":"on.","s":147.17,"e":147.65},{"w":"That","s":147.73,"e":148.05},{"w":"expression","s":148.05,"e":148.53},{"w":"deserves","s":148.53,"e":149.01},{"w":"a","s":149.01,"e":149.17},{"w":"moment","s":149.17,"e":149.41},{"w":"of","s":149.41,"e":149.57},{"w":"its","s":149.57,"e":149.81},{"w":"own.","s":149.81,"e":150.21}]},{"speaker":"David","start":150.53,"end":157.805,"text":"The butt of the joke is the person everyone is laughing at. The target. Not laughing with you — laughing at you.","words":[{"w":"The","s":150.53,"e":150.77},{"w":"butt","s":150.77,"e":151.01},{"w":"of","s":151.01,"e":151.17},{"w":"the","s":151.17,"e":151.33},{"w":"joke","s":151.33,"e":151.65},{"w":"is","s":151.65,"e":151.89},{"w":"the","s":151.89,"e":152.05},{"w":"person","s":152.05,"e":152.37},{"w":"everyone","s":152.37,"e":152.93},{"w":"is","s":152.93,"e":153.09},{"w":"laughing","s":153.09,"e":153.41},{"w":"at.","s":153.41,"e":153.97},{"w":"The","s":154.21,"e":154.37},{"w":"target.","s":154.37,"e":155.09},{"w":"Not","s":155.25,"e":155.49},{"w":"laughing","s":155.49,"e":155.89},{"w":"with","s":155.89,"e":156.13},{"w":"you","s":156.13,"e":156.37},{"w":"—","s":156.37,"e":156.685},{"w":"laughing","s":156.685,"e":157.165},{"w":"at","s":157.165,"e":157.405},{"w":"you.","s":157.405,"e":157.805}]},{"speaker":"Alice","start":157.805,"end":164.045,"text":"So if a comedian keeps mocking one guy in the audience, that poor guy is the butt of the joke all night.","words":[{"w":"So","s":157.805,"e":158.125},{"w":"if","s":158.125,"e":158.285},{"w":"a","s":158.285,"e":158.445},{"w":"comedian","s":158.445,"e":158.925},{"w":"keeps","s":158.925,"e":159.245},{"w":"mocking","s":159.245,"e":159.725},{"w":"one","s":159.725,"e":159.965},{"w":"guy","s":159.965,"e":160.205},{"w":"in","s":160.205,"e":160.365},{"w":"the","s":160.365,"e":160.525},{"w":"audience,","s":160.525,"e":161.165},{"w":"that","s":161.405,"e":161.565},{"w":"poor","s":161.565,"e":161.965},{"w":"guy","s":161.965,"e":162.205},{"w":"is","s":162.205,"e":162.365},{"w":"the","s":162.365,"e":162.525},{"w":"butt","s":162.525,"e":162.685},{"w":"of","s":162.685,"e":162.845},{"w":"the","s":162.845,"e":163.005},{"w":"joke","s":163.005,"e":163.245},{"w":"all","s":163.245,"e":163.485},{"w":"night.","s":163.485,"e":164.045}]},{"speaker":"David","start":164.285,"end":172.12,"text":"Exactly. And that winter, Eddie was the butt of every joke in the papers. One even called him Mister Magoo on skis.","words":[{"w":"Exactly.","s":164.285,"e":165.165},{"w":"And","s":165.245,"e":165.565},{"w":"that","s":165.565,"e":165.805},{"w":"winter,","s":165.805,"e":166.525},{"w":"Eddie","s":166.525,"e":166.765},{"w":"was","s":166.765,"e":167.005},{"w":"the","s":167.005,"e":167.165},{"w":"butt","s":167.165,"e":167.405},{"w":"of","s":167.405,"e":167.565},{"w":"every","s":167.565,"e":167.885},{"w":"joke","s":167.885,"e":168.205},{"w":"in","s":168.205,"e":168.365},{"w":"the","s":168.365,"e":168.445},{"w":"papers.","s":168.445,"e":168.845},{"w":"One","s":169.24,"e":169.56},{"w":"even","s":169.56,"e":169.88},{"w":"called","s":169.88,"e":170.2},{"w":"him","s":170.2,"e":170.36},{"w":"Mister","s":170.36,"e":170.76},{"w":"Magoo","s":170.76,"e":171.16},{"w":"on","s":171.16,"e":171.4},{"w":"skis.","s":171.4,"e":172.12}]},{"speaker":"Alice","start":172.12,"end":179.8,"text":"But here's what gets me: he didn't care. He waved at the cameras, flapped his arms like wings, and grinned through everything.","words":[{"w":"But","s":172.12,"e":172.28},{"w":"here's","s":172.28,"e":172.68},{"w":"what","s":172.68,"e":172.84},{"w":"gets","s":172.84,"e":173.16},{"w":"me:","s":173.16,"e":173.64},{"w":"he","s":173.8,"e":173.96},{"w":"didn't","s":173.96,"e":174.28},{"w":"care.","s":174.28,"e":174.84},{"w":"He","s":175,"e":175.08},{"w":"waved","s":175.08,"e":175.48},{"w":"at","s":175.48,"e":175.64},{"w":"the","s":175.64,"e":175.72},{"w":"cameras,","s":175.72,"e":176.44},{"w":"flapped","s":176.44,"e":176.84},{"w":"his","s":176.84,"e":177},{"w":"arms","s":177,"e":177.24},{"w":"like","s":177.24,"e":177.56},{"w":"wings,","s":177.56,"e":178.2},{"w":"and","s":178.2,"e":178.36},{"w":"grinned","s":178.36,"e":178.84},{"w":"through","s":178.84,"e":179.08},{"w":"everything.","s":179.08,"e":179.8}]},{"speaker":"David","start":180.12,"end":186.335,"text":"Because he wasn't naive. He knew exactly what the crowd wanted, and he delivered it with a huge smile.","words":[{"w":"Because","s":180.12,"e":180.44},{"w":"he","s":180.44,"e":180.6},{"w":"wasn't","s":180.6,"e":181},{"w":"naive.","s":181,"e":181.4},{"w":"He","s":181.775,"e":182.015},{"w":"knew","s":182.015,"e":182.335},{"w":"exactly","s":182.335,"e":182.735},{"w":"what","s":182.735,"e":182.975},{"w":"the","s":182.975,"e":183.135},{"w":"crowd","s":183.135,"e":183.455},{"w":"wanted,","s":183.455,"e":184.095},{"w":"and","s":184.175,"e":184.335},{"w":"he","s":184.335,"e":184.495},{"w":"delivered","s":184.495,"e":184.895},{"w":"it","s":184.895,"e":185.055},{"w":"with","s":185.055,"e":185.215},{"w":"a","s":185.215,"e":185.375},{"w":"huge","s":185.375,"e":185.695},{"w":"smile.","s":185.695,"e":186.335}]},{"speaker":"Alice","start":186.335,"end":194.575,"text":"Even the closing ceremony! The organizing committee's president told the athletes some of them had soared like an eagle. Everyone knew who he meant.","words":[{"w":"Even","s":186.335,"e":186.575},{"w":"the","s":186.575,"e":186.815},{"w":"closing","s":186.815,"e":187.215},{"w":"ceremony!","s":187.215,"e":188.175},{"w":"The","s":188.335,"e":188.495},{"w":"organizing","s":188.495,"e":189.135},{"w":"committee's","s":189.135,"e":189.695},{"w":"president","s":189.695,"e":190.175},{"w":"told","s":190.175,"e":190.495},{"w":"the","s":190.495,"e":190.655},{"w":"athletes","s":190.655,"e":191.055},{"w":"some","s":191.055,"e":191.375},{"w":"of","s":191.375,"e":191.535},{"w":"them","s":191.535,"e":191.615},{"w":"had","s":191.615,"e":191.855},{"w":"soared","s":191.855,"e":192.255},{"w":"like","s":192.255,"e":192.415},{"w":"an","s":192.415,"e":192.575},{"w":"eagle.","s":192.575,"e":193.215},{"w":"Everyone","s":193.295,"e":193.695},{"w":"knew","s":193.695,"e":194.015},{"w":"who","s":194.015,"e":194.255},{"w":"he","s":194.255,"e":194.415},{"w":"meant.","s":194.415,"e":194.575}]},{"speaker":"David","start":195.21,"end":199.93,"text":"Meanwhile, the gold medalist in ski jumping that year — quick, name him.","words":[{"w":"Meanwhile,","s":195.21,"e":196.01},{"w":"the","s":196.09,"e":196.25},{"w":"gold","s":196.25,"e":196.57},{"w":"medalist","s":196.57,"e":197.05},{"w":"in","s":197.05,"e":197.21},{"w":"ski","s":197.21,"e":197.53},{"w":"jumping","s":197.53,"e":197.85},{"w":"that","s":197.85,"e":198.17},{"w":"year","s":198.17,"e":198.73},{"w":"—","s":198.73,"e":198.76999999999998},{"w":"quick,","s":198.73,"e":199.29},{"w":"name","s":199.29,"e":199.61},{"w":"him.","s":199.61,"e":199.93}]},{"speaker":"Alice","start":199.93,"end":204.41,"text":"I... genuinely cannot. And that, David, is my entire point.","words":[{"w":"I...","s":199.93,"e":200.33},{"w":"genuinely","s":200.33,"e":201.37},{"w":"cannot.","s":201.37,"e":202.09},{"w":"And","s":202.17,"e":202.33},{"w":"that,","s":202.33,"e":202.57},{"w":"David,","s":202.57,"e":202.97},{"w":"is","s":202.97,"e":203.21},{"w":"my","s":203.21,"e":203.45},{"w":"entire","s":203.45,"e":203.85},{"w":"point.","s":203.85,"e":204.41}]},{"speaker":"David","start":204.73,"end":213.145,"text":"Which brings us to the uncomfortable part. The Olympic Committee watched this spectacle and asked a hard question: is this what the Games are for?","words":[{"w":"Which","s":204.73,"e":204.97},{"w":"brings","s":204.97,"e":205.29},{"w":"us","s":205.29,"e":205.53},{"w":"to","s":205.53,"e":205.69},{"w":"the","s":205.69,"e":205.85},{"w":"uncomfortable","s":205.85,"e":206.49},{"w":"part.","s":206.49,"e":206.73},{"w":"The","s":207.145,"e":207.465},{"w":"Olympic","s":207.465,"e":207.865},{"w":"Committee","s":207.865,"e":208.265},{"w":"watched","s":208.265,"e":208.585},{"w":"this","s":208.585,"e":208.905},{"w":"spectacle","s":208.905,"e":209.465},{"w":"and","s":209.465,"e":209.785},{"w":"asked","s":209.785,"e":210.105},{"w":"a","s":210.105,"e":210.265},{"w":"hard","s":210.265,"e":210.585},{"w":"question:","s":210.585,"e":211.225},{"w":"is","s":211.305,"e":211.625},{"w":"this","s":211.625,"e":211.785},{"w":"what","s":211.785,"e":212.025},{"w":"the","s":212.025,"e":212.185},{"w":"Games","s":212.185,"e":212.505},{"w":"are","s":212.505,"e":212.665},{"w":"for?","s":212.665,"e":213.145}]},{"speaker":"Alice","start":213.145,"end":214.825,"text":"Ugh, here we go.","words":[{"w":"Ugh,","s":213.145,"e":213.705},{"w":"here","s":213.705,"e":214.105},{"w":"we","s":214.105,"e":214.265},{"w":"go.","s":214.265,"e":214.825}]},{"speaker":"David","start":214.985,"end":224.2,"text":"No, it's fair! Athletes sacrifice everything for this, and the headlines went to a man who finished last. Doesn't that cheapen the competition?","words":[{"w":"No,","s":214.985,"e":215.625},{"w":"it's","s":215.625,"e":215.945},{"w":"fair!","s":215.945,"e":216.505},{"w":"Athletes","s":216.745,"e":217.225},{"w":"sacrifice","s":217.225,"e":217.945},{"w":"everything","s":217.945,"e":218.425},{"w":"for","s":218.425,"e":218.585},{"w":"this,","s":218.585,"e":218.745},{"w":"and","s":219,"e":219.32},{"w":"the","s":219.32,"e":219.48},{"w":"headlines","s":219.48,"e":219.88},{"w":"went","s":219.88,"e":220.2},{"w":"to","s":220.2,"e":220.36},{"w":"a","s":220.36,"e":220.52},{"w":"man","s":220.52,"e":220.76},{"w":"who","s":220.76,"e":221},{"w":"finished","s":221,"e":221.4},{"w":"last.","s":221.4,"e":222.04},{"w":"Doesn't","s":222.28,"e":222.6},{"w":"that","s":222.6,"e":222.84},{"w":"cheapen","s":222.84,"e":223.24},{"w":"the","s":223.24,"e":223.4},{"w":"competition?","s":223.4,"e":224.2}]},{"speaker":"Alice","start":224.52,"end":233.24,"text":"Or does it capture the original Olympic spirit? The important thing is not winning but taking part — that is literally the founder's famous line.","words":[{"w":"Or","s":224.52,"e":224.76},{"w":"does","s":224.76,"e":225},{"w":"it","s":225,"e":225.16},{"w":"capture","s":225.16,"e":225.56},{"w":"the","s":225.56,"e":225.72},{"w":"original","s":225.72,"e":226.2},{"w":"Olympic","s":226.2,"e":226.76},{"w":"spirit?","s":226.76,"e":227.48},{"w":"The","s":227.64,"e":227.96},{"w":"important","s":227.96,"e":228.44},{"w":"thing","s":228.44,"e":228.68},{"w":"is","s":228.68,"e":228.92},{"w":"not","s":228.92,"e":229.16},{"w":"winning","s":229.16,"e":229.48},{"w":"but","s":229.48,"e":229.8},{"w":"taking","s":229.8,"e":230.2},{"w":"part","s":230.2,"e":230.76},{"w":"—","s":230.76,"e":230.92},{"w":"that","s":230.92,"e":231.16},{"w":"is","s":231.16,"e":231.4},{"w":"literally","s":231.4,"e":231.88},{"w":"the","s":231.88,"e":232.04},{"w":"founder's","s":232.04,"e":232.6},{"w":"famous","s":232.6,"e":232.92},{"w":"line.","s":232.92,"e":233.24}]},{"speaker":"David","start":233.695,"end":244.975,"text":"Well, the Committee sided with me. They introduced stricter qualifying standards, forcing athletes to prove themselves internationally first. It's ni